\newlabel{fig:shap_dep_pol}{{21b}{90}{SHAP dependence plot for \texttt {policy\_b4} (WGI Rule of Law, country level). The monotone positive relationship indicates that stronger rule-of-law institutions are associated with higher designation probability across the continent, confirming governance quality as an independent predictor rather than a proxy for ecological value.\relax }{figure.caption.76}{}}
